         NodeComment="This path starts the Jump Up Spring actor interaction. Here we set some default variables and use the saved Tags to get some values from the Jump Up Spring actor, like the boolean for ignoring input or not, and the launch location vector. Those tags are saved during the Jump Up Spring construction script."
