         bCommentBubbleVisible=False
         NodeComment="Before selecting the animation that will play after linking with the Anim Class Layer, we decide or not ignoring movement input. Then we start this component tick, save the launch height and then begin updating the curve value used to modify the X and Y location of the character, in case we set it to reposition while launching."
