         bCommentBubblePinned=False
         bCommentBubbleVisible=False
         NodeComment="We predict the launch velocity using the data stored in the platformer actor tag, so the character is launched following the trace. Then we restore movement input or keep ignoring it depending on if we chose to restore it after landing."
