         bCommentBubblePinned=False
         bCommentBubbleVisible=False
         NodeComment="We can delay the execution for a few frames in case there is a system that is finishing some logic that updates the rotation / location of the Character. Here, we do it in case this component is used with another one I made (Third Person Homing Attack). There, we wait and keep the Character in place for a couple of frames before using this system. This will be ignored otherwise."
         NodeGuid=41192CDD4C0A26DD021D43980CD5E2DE
      End Object
